    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "1. Mr Priyadarshi Manish, who appears for the petitioners in the above- W.P.(C) 1987/2022 & 1988/2022 page 1 of 4 captioned matters, relies upon an order dated 20.07.2020 passed by the Joint Director (Science & Standards Division), Food Safety and Standards Authority of India [in short \"FSSAI\"], in support of the case set up by the petitioners.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1068,
      "end": 1414,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Priyadarshi Manish",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1074,
          "end": 1092
        },
        {
          "text": "W.P.(C) 1987/2022 & 1988/2022",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1140,
          "end": 1169
        },
        {
          "text": "20.07.2020",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1228,
          "end": 1238
        },
        {
          "text": "Food Safety and Standards Authority of India",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1300,
          "end": 1344
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "[See Annexure P-6, appended on page 81 of the case file in W.P.(C) No. 1987/2022.]",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1415,
      "end": 1497,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "W.P.(C) No. 1987/2022",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1474,
          "end": 1495
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "1.1. A perusal of the said order passed by FSSAI shows that the same was passed, pursuant to a direction issued by a coordinate M/S M.M. Traders vs Commissioner Of Customs & Ors on 17 May, 2022 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/76628183/\n1 bench of this Court via order dated 30.01.2020, passed in W.P.(C) No.13025/2018. 1.2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1498,
      "end": 1833,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "FSSAI",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1541,
          "end": 1546
        },
        {
          "text": "M/S M.M. Traders vs Commissioner Of Customs & Ors",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1626,
          "end": 1675
        },
        {
          "text": "17 May, 2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1679,
          "end": 1691
        },
        {
          "text": "Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1692,
          "end": 1705
        },
        {
          "text": "30.01.2020",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1784,
          "end": 1794
        },
        {
          "text": "W.P.(C) No.13025/2018",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1806,
          "end": 1827
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "It appears,\nupon a perusal of the order passed by FSSAI [i.e., order dated 20.07.2020], that the said order came to be passed based on recommendations of a \"Scientific Panel\".",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1834,
      "end": 2009,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "FSSAI",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1884,
          "end": 1889
        },
        {
          "text": "20.07.2020",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1909,
          "end": 1919
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "2. The point in issue in the instant case is : whether or not the substance in issue, which is Ethephon (Ethrel), requires a No-Objection Certificate [in short \"NOC\"] from respondent no.3 i.e., Central Insecticide Board & Registration Committee [in short \"CIB&RC\"] and registration with the said entity.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ISSUE",
      "start": 2011,
      "end": 2314,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Central Insecticide Board & Registration Committee",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2205,
          "end": 2255
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27758026123046875
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "2.1. It is not in dispute that Ethrel [also known as Ethephon] is mentioned in the Schedule appended to the Insecticides Act, 1968 [in short \"the 1968 Act\"].\n2.2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2316,
      "end": 2478,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ethrel",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2347,
          "end": 2353
        },
        {
          "text": "Insecticides Act, 1968",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2424,
          "end": 2446
        },
        {
          "text": "1968 Act",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2462,
          "end": 2470
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "The respondents have detained the subject goods i.e., the aforementioned substance i.e.,\nEthephon (Ethrel) which is in powder form, on the ground that a NOC from respondent no.3/CIB&RC and registration with the said entity, has not been obtained.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2479,
      "end": 2725,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "CIB&RC",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 2657,
          "end": 2663
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.46685564517974854
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "W.P.(C) 1987/2022 & 1988/2022 page 2 of 4 3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2726,
      "end": 2771,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "W.P.(C) 1987/2022 & 1988/2022",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 2727,
          "end": 2756
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "It is the stand of respondent no.3/CIB&RC that a registration certificate or an import permit was required, before allowing the import of the said substance.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2772,
      "end": 2929,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "CIB&RC",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 2807,
          "end": 2813
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "3.1. Mr Manish, obviously, disputes the position taken by respondent no.3/CIB&RC.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2931,
      "end": 3012,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Manish",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2939,
          "end": 2945
        },
        {
          "text": "CIB&RC",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 3005,
          "end": 3011
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "4. Before we proceed further, we would like to hear FSSAI in the above- captioned matters.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3014,
      "end": 3104,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "FSSAI",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3066,
          "end": 3071
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "This direction has also been necessitated in view of the communication dated 05.10.2021 addressed by the FSSAI to another entity i.e., Gold Ripe International Pvt. Ltd.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3105,
      "end": 3273,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "05.10.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3182,
          "end": 3192
        },
        {
          "text": "FSSAI",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3210,
          "end": 3215
        },
        {
          "text": "Gold Ripe International Pvt. Ltd.",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3240,
          "end": 3273
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "A copy of the said communication was placed before us, in Court, by counsel for respondent no.3/CIB&RC.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3274,
      "end": 3377,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "CIB&RC",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 3370,
          "end": 3376
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "Although we are told that the said document has been filed, we are told that the same is lying under objection with the Registry.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3378,
      "end": 3507,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "4.1. Accordingly, FSSAI is arrayed as a party to the present proceedings.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3508,
      "end": 3581,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "FSSAI",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3526,
          "end": 3531
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.29132282733917236
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "FSSAI will stand arrayed as respondent no.4 in the matters.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3582,
      "end": 3641,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "FSSAI",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3582,
          "end": 3587
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "4.2. Mr Manish will take steps to file the amended memo of parties.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3642,
      "end": 3709,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Manish",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3650,
          "end": 3656
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "4.3. Notice shall issue to FSSAI, via all permissible modes, including e- mail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3710,
      "end": 3789,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "FSSAI",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3737,
          "end": 3742
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24900683760643005
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "5. At this stage, Mr Aditya Singla accepts notice on behalf of FSSAI.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3791,
      "end": 3860,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Aditya Singla",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3812,
          "end": 3825
        },
        {
          "text": "FSSAI",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3854,
          "end": 3859
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "6. FSSAI will place before the Court, inter alia, the recommendations of the Scientific Panel, which,\napparently, was the edifice of the order passed by its Joint Director, which as noticed above, is dated 20.07.2020.\n7.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3862,
      "end": 4082,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "20.07.2020",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 4068,
          "end": 4078
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10982035100460052
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "Since the respondents have already in their possession the subject substance; therefore, a sample out of the same will be handed over to respondent no.3/CIB&RC.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 4083,
      "end": 4243,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "CIB&RC",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 4236,
          "end": 4242
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "W.P.(C) 1987/2022 & 1988/2022 page 3 of 4 7.1.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 4245,
      "end": 4291,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "W.P.(C) 1987/2022 & 1988/2022",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 4245,
          "end": 4274
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "Respondent no.3/CIB&RC will get the sample tested in its laboratory and place the report before the Court, bearing in mind the provisions of Section 38(1)(b) of the 1968 Act, albeit prior to the next of hearing.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 4292,
      "end": 4503,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "CIB&RC",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 4308,
          "end": 4314
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 38(1)(b)",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4433,
          "end": 4449
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
